The [[Staff of the Mists]] is the twin of the powerful [[Scepter of Orr]], and has lain hidden for many years beneath an altar in the [[Poisoned Outcrops]]. The [[Margonite]]s have become aware of the location of the staff and try to claim the staff during the events of [[The Cold Touch of the Past]].

